    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_05",
      "hash64": "0E6C391207302113",
      "text": "那個就是那個啊！\\n我們見到的！鬼……鬼鬼祟祟的小毛頭！\\r\\n真是的！想不到[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳挺壞心眼的！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
