    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student1_01",
      "hash64": "9ECF9DCC98F6C72D",
      "text": "我只找到了１個看板！\\n丹瑜她根本都不在！\\r\\n但是，就是她那自由自在的個性……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student2_01",
      "hash64": "459ADDB351A5A0BA",
      "text": "烏栗似乎是很怕生？\\n他對[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳倒是敞開心扉了呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student3_01",
      "hash64": "1B1CC9BE9B0E2E6F",
      "text": "雖然我還不習慣這悶熱的天氣，\\n但我漸漸習慣蟲屬性寶可夢囉！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "03895AFDBDF115D5",
      "text": "掩面祭還會持續一段時間，\\n請盡情地去玩喔。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
